<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24709" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδῐκ-ᾰσία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suit to decide between
				claimants,</i> e.g. to an estate, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κλήρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					44.7
				</span></i>
			; to a wardship, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐπιτροπῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					56.6
				</span></i>
			; to exemption from a <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειτουργία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				28.17
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				17.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.13
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(5).722.48
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Andros</span>); esp. of <i>judicial
				inquiries</i> relating to naval matters, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				47.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				61.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>judicial decision</i> or <i>settlement,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.1.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				437.78
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τῷ βήματι πρὸς τὸ στρατήγιον</span>
			<i>dispute</i> between the orators and the board of generals,
				<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.146
			</span></i>: generally, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τῶν ἀριστείων δ.</span>
			<i>the competition for</i> public honours, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				952d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Polem.
				<u>Call.</u>
				53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδικασίαν προθεῖναι ταῖς
			γνώμαις</span> put <i>the question</i> to the vote, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				11.21
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
